    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/2233b7592e0f21a30d25176cb2cc34fe.webp?t=1715915549\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/6bd503b753b9a2188bcfb57a529732fc.avif?t=1715915549\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRUTAL SINGLEPLAYER CAMPAIGN</h2><strong>You play as a mercenary hell-bent on getting revenge against the criminal underworld that betrayed you. Fight in fully destructible levels where everything can be ripped down.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/8aaac49fcf89d922c4d6926b33763a76.poster.avif?t=1715915549\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/8aaac49fcf89d922c4d6926b33763a76.webm?t=1715915549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/8aaac49fcf89d922c4d6926b33763a76.mp4?t=1715915549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/0efa769256c306d028a5b3547531d465.avif?t=1715915549\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE GAME ENGINE CONTROL</h2><strong>WRECK has substantial modding tools to build new maps and weapons. Share your creations with the community and see how other players have changed the game.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/efa8049468e8654fd84320d01e642f92.poster.avif?t=1715915549\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/efa8049468e8654fd84320d01e642f92.webm?t=1715915549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/efa8049468e8654fd84320d01e642f92.mp4?t=1715915549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the development:</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/2233b7592e0f21a30d25176cb2cc34fe.webp?t=1715915549\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/6bd503b753b9a2188bcfb57a529732fc.avif?t=1715915549\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRUTAL SINGLEPLAYER CAMPAIGN</h2><strong>You play as a mercenary hell-bent on getting revenge against the criminal underworld that betrayed you. Fight in fully destructible levels where everything can be ripped down.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/8aaac49fcf89d922c4d6926b33763a76.poster.avif?t=1715915549\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/8aaac49fcf89d922c4d6926b33763a76.webm?t=1715915549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/8aaac49fcf89d922c4d6926b33763a76.mp4?t=1715915549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/0efa769256c306d028a5b3547531d465.avif?t=1715915549\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE GAME ENGINE CONTROL</h2><strong>WRECK has substantial modding tools to build new maps and weapons. Share your creations with the community and see how other players have changed the game.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2384120/extras/efa8049468e8654fd84320d01e642f92.poster.avif?t=1715915549\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam